</li>
<li id="user-content-fn-5"><p>Pipili: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pipli_4.jpg">Rahul Mukherjee</a>, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>; resized and converted to WebP, with the same licence. Silver filigree: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Silver_Filigree_Work.jpg">Government of Odisha</a>, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>; resized and converted for layout. Raghurajpur: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Raghurajpur_1.jpg">Rangan Datta Wiki</a>, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>; resized for local delivery, with the same licence. <a href="#user-content-fnref-5" data-footnote-backref="" aria-label="Return to reading-link photograph reference" class="data-footnote-backref">↩</a></p></li>
